        <field>Body__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:string">&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Click the dashboard title in the toolbar to rename it.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Click &lt;strong&gt;+ Widget&lt;/strong&gt; to start the Add Widget flow: pick a type (Chart / Text / Image / LWC), then a report (for charts), then configure the tile.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Drag a tile&apos;s header to reposition it; drag the bottom-right corner to resize. The canvas snaps to the configured grid (12 or 9 columns).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Click the &lt;strong&gt;✎&lt;/strong&gt; (edit) icon on a tile to reopen its configuration; click &lt;strong&gt;🗑&lt;/strong&gt; to remove it.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Click &lt;strong&gt;Save&lt;/strong&gt; to persist. The split button also offers &lt;strong&gt;Save As&lt;/strong&gt; (clone) and &lt;strong&gt;Delete&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</value>
    </values>
